data: {"spec":{"version":1,"id":"gen-e3356cc7","concept":"Package","title":"Classes and methods","description":"Methods, lines of code and cyclomatic complexity of the classes of this package.","queries":{"package":{"query":"query($id: ID!) { package(id: $id) { id name classes { id name methods { id numberOfLinesOfCode cyclomaticComplexity } } } }"}},"widgets":[{"type":"bar","id":"methods-per-class","title":"Number of methods per class","span":24,"height":320,"data":{"query":"package","path":"package.classes","transform":{"derive":[{"as":"methodCount","op":"count","field":"methods"}],"sort":{"by":"methodCount","dir":"desc"},"limit":30}},"xField":"name","yField":"methodCount"},{"type":"table","id":"classes","title":"Classes","span":24,"data":{"query":"package","path":"package.classes","transform":{"derive":[{"as":"methodCount","op":"count","field":"methods"},{"as":"loc","op":"sum","field":"methods.numberOfLinesOfCode"},{"as":"cyclo","op":"sum","field":"methods.cyclomaticComplexity"}],"sort":{"by":"methodCount","dir":"desc"}}},"columns":[{"key":"name","title":"Class","linkTo":{"concept":"Class"}},{"key":"methodCount","title":"Methods","format":"number"},{"key":"loc","title":"Lines of code","format":"number"},{"key":"cyclo","title":"Cyclomatic complexity","format":"number"}],"pageSize":15}],"scope":"detail"},"provider":"claude-code","model":"sonnet","reasoning":["Une seule requête `package` qui sélectionne les classes avec leurs méthodes (nombre calculé via `derive`) pour alimenter le graphique et le tableau.","Un diagramme en barres du nombre de méthodes par classe, trié par ordre décroissant (limité aux 30 premières classes pour rester lisible).","Un tableau des classes avec nombre de méthodes, lignes de code et complexité cyclomatique, trié par nombre de méthodes décroissant.","Le schéma n'expose pas de champs de lignes de code ou de complexité sur Class dans les relations atteignables : je les calcule en sommant les champs des méthodes (`classes.methods.cyclomaticComplexity`, `classes.methods.numberOfLinesOfCode`).","Chaque classe est un lien vers son propre concept `Class`."]}

